{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0009","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:04:08.972356Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0009"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0009","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 4 prematurely escalated the person's fear of failure to a suicide-resource referral, which they explicitly found jarring, while turn 12 mostly repeated their words and assumed they were waiting for a decision rather than exploring the stated feeling that this was their only shot.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0012","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:04:21.053125Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0012"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0012","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Question","Reflection of feelings"],"note":"Although consistently attentive to the friendship conflict, turns 8 and 12 largely repeat the person's stated feelings and interpretation without adding much further understanding.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
