{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0018","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:00.777850Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0018"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0018","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question"],"note":"The helper was supportive, but turns 2 and 12 largely repeated the user’s stated feelings without deepening understanding, and turn 12 asked what would make compliments genuine after she had already explained that she wanted spontaneous noticing.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0022","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:09.835893Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0022"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0022","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":2,"relevance":2,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Despite appropriately addressing suicidal thoughts and suggesting company, turns 6, 8, 10, and 12 repeat suicide screening after the person has answered, with the repeated crisis script crowding out responses to their fear, burden concerns, and continuing low mood.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0023","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:17.515512Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0023"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0023","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Question","Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question"],"note":"Turns 4 and 8 pivot to study planning before adequately addressing the user's fear and self-blame, while turn 12 abruptly introduces suicide screening and 988 without any user disclosure of suicidality.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0024","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:31.968929Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0024"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0024","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Question"],"note":"Turns 2 and 4 mostly echo the user's fears, and the repeated reflective openings in turns 2, 4, 6, and 8 make the empathy formulaic, although the helper consistently respects the user's work and scheduling constraints.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0038","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:42.667837Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0038"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0038","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 mostly mirrors the user's words, turn 8 asks about blame already described, turn 10 shifts to functioning before exploring the user's revealing admission about fault, and turn 12 offers a generic referral rather than deepening that understanding.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0054","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:57.958138Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0054"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0054","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question"],"note":"Turns 2 and 8 largely repeat or re-ask what the person has shared, while turn 12 abruptly introduces suicide screening and 988 without expressed suicidality and stacks questions, weakening an otherwise supportive response to shame and fears about the threat to their family.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0061","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:06:08.276950Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0061"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0061","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 moves prematurely from grief into professional-help advice, and turn 6 repeats that generic referral, although the later suggestions about asking the sister for company fit the person's needs closely.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0082","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:06:16.219713Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0082"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0082","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":5,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Reflection of feelings","Reflection of feelings","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question"],"note":"No helper turns were counted as weak; turn 10 specifically addressed the user's shame by distinguishing hoping for contact from begging for care.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0093","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:06:27.446305Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0093"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0093","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 12 weakens an otherwise attentive exchange by largely repeating the user's feelings and asking what they need to hear immediately after they explained their need for acknowledgment and reassurance about their worth.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:06:39.432066Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 2 prematurely shifted body shame to suicide screening and a crisis resource, turn 6 stacked questions onto a referral, and turn 8 repeated that referral while leaving the person's fear that eating would cause weight gain unexplored.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:06:49.981694Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Question","Reflection of feelings","Question"],"note":"Turn 6 weakens empathy and relevance by introducing counselling before fully exploring the fear, although the helper subsequently respects the person's wish to keep talking.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0111","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:07:01.018496Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0111"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0111","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 6 moved into rough-draft advice before fully exploring the user's self-criticism or distinguishing drafting from submitting, leaving the fear of handing in inadequate work unaddressed until the user clarified it.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0129","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:07:13.206173Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0129"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0129","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Question","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turns 2, 4, and 6 repeat the same reflective opening, and turn 6 weakens understanding by reframing guilt about time spent creating as another performance test, then shifting to career pressures instead of exploring that conflict.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0137","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T14:07:22.180792Z","parent_ids":["conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0137"],"conversation_id":"conv-r09-val-esconv-validation-0137","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Reflection of feelings","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question"],"note":"The helper understood the fear of exclusion, but turn 8 largely repeated the user's words without deepening the emotional reflection, and turn 12 revisited the onset of awkwardness already explained in turn 5.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
